            "padding_bottom_mobile": "pb-0",
            "margin_top_desktop": "desktop:mt-0",
            "margin_bottom_desktop": "desktop:mb-0",
            "padding_top_desktop": "desktop:pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-0",
            "max_width_desktop": "1000px",
            "image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Image_Ratio_Keeper.png",
            "image_desktop": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Image_Ratio_Keeper.png",
            "caption": "<p>Above: The <strong>Blueair Humidifier <\/strong>at use in a medium sized room<\/p>",
            "caption_style": "p6",
            "product": "h35i-humidifier"
          }
        },
        "text_e9yarP": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "margin_top_mobile": "mt-0",
            "margin_bottom_mobile": "mb-md",
            "padding_top_mobile": "pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_mobile": "pb-0",
            "margin_top_desktop": "desktop:mt-0",
            "margin_bottom_desktop": "desktop:mb-lg",
            "padding_top_desktop": "desktop:pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-0",
            "max_width_desktop": "95ch",
            "richtext": "<h4>What Sleep Benefits Does a Humidifier Provide?<\/h4><p>Sleeping better with a humidifier can result because of a few different direct benefits a humidifier can provide:<\/p><p>1. Maintaining your optimal humidity level increases overall comfort when trying to go to sleep. This humidity can help ease an itchy, irritated throat.<\/p><p>2. A humidifier creates a ‘white noise’ effect while it runs overnight. The soft hum of a fan or humidifier has been shown to help people calm down, slow breathing, and fall asleep.<\/p><p>3. Turning on a humidifier before you go to bed can also help alleviate loud snoring by providing more moisture to the mouth, nasal cavities, pallet and airways. When these areas become dried out, it tends to make snoring worse - the vibrations of these dry tissues caused by each breath in and out can even intensify the sound of snoring.<br\/><br\/><\/p><h4>Which Time of Year is Best to Use a Humidifier?<\/h4>",
            "richtext_style": "p2"
          }
        },
